== novec_trap_directed (sw/core-tests/, no-vector configuration only)
Self-checking; for each trapping case: exactly one trap, mcause 2,
mepc = the instruction's address, mtval = its 32-bit encoding (read back
from memory), and the source mode recorded from mstatus.MPP/MPV.
  1-8     misa = 0x8000_0000_0014_11AF; mstatus.VS, sstatus.VS (csrs and csrw),
          vsstatus.VS read 0 after writing 3; mstatus.SD / vsstatus.SD = 0
          with FS = Off; SD = 1 with FS = Dirty
  10-30   vector CSRs vstart, vxsat, vxrm, vcsr, vl, vtype, vlenb: csrr,
          csrw, csrrs/csrrc, immediate forms, write-only (rd = x0) forms
  31-55   vsetvli (two forms), vsetivli, vsetvl; OPIVV, OPFVV, OPMVV, OPIVI,
          OPIVX, OPFVF, OPMVX; vmv.x.s, vfmv.f.s, vmv1r.v, vredsum, vcpop,
          viota, vmseq, masked op, vfwcvt, vmv.v.i, vid, vslideup, vrgather,
          vcompress
  60-93   vle8/16/32/64 (widths 000/101/110/111), masked, vlse, vluxei,
          vloxei, vl1re8, vl8re64, vlm, vle8ff, vlseg2, vlsseg3, vluxseg2;
          vse8/16/32/64, masked, vsse, vsuxei, vsoxei, vs1r, vs8r, vsm,
          vsseg3, vssseg2, vsoxseg2
  100-119 from S, U, VS (V=1) and VU (V=1): cause 2 (not 22), taken to M
  120-127 fld/flw/fsd/fsw + fadd.d/fadd.s exact results, no traps,
          FS = Dirty, VS = 0, SD = 1, fflags 0
RTL: core_tb_novec PASS (rand 18065 cycles, uncached 26141 cycles; sky130novec
